              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 45:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye nze Musengwa Katonda nkoba nti, ndi kumenhamenhagho kye nazimba era ndi kwiwululagho kye nasimba. Era nja kukola ntyo ensi eno yoonayoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 45:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obwo iwe oli kwenda obisibwe mu nsambo ey'endhawulo? Busa naire, ebyo biveeku. Ndidha kuleeta akabi ku bantu boonaboona. Aye iwe weesuneku, kuba oidha kuwoniangagho obulamu bwo, eyo yoonayoona y'olija. Nze Musengwa Katonda, ninze nkobye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
